Lobsters are creatures that may be cooked in [[Cauldron]] to make [[Boiled Lobster]].

== How to Acquire ==

Main way to catch lobsters is with [[Lobster Pot]] in the Ocean [[Deep Water]].

Alternatively, it's common for [[Tidepool|Tide Pool]]s to have at least one inside.

